1. Official Exam Question Pool & Examination Figures (Public Domain)
===============================================================================
The 409 Element 2 (Technician Class) examination questions, answer choices,
FCC Part 97 rule citations, syllabus structure, February 19, 2026 errata
revisions, and underlying circuit topologies for Figures T-1, T-2, and T-3
were created by the National Conference of Volunteer Examiner Coordinators
(NCVEC) Question Pool Committee for use from July 1, 2026 through June 30,
2030, and are released into the public domain:
  https://www.ncvec.org/index.php/2026-2030-technician-question-pool

===============================================================================
2. Machine-Readable Pool Data Conversion (Apache License 2.0)
===============================================================================
The raw machine-readable JSON and plain-text pool files stored in
`scripts/pool_raw.json`, `scripts/pool_raw.txt`, and reference PNG renders
(`scripts/t-1.png`, `scripts/t-2.png`, `scripts/t-3.png`) originate from:
  russolsen/ham_radio_question_pool
  https://github.com/russolsen/ham_radio_question_pool
  Copyright Russ Olsen and contributors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

State of Changes (Apache-2.0 Section 4(b)):
  `scripts/build_data.py` transforms `scripts/pool_raw.json` into `data.js`
  (`window.HAM_DATA`), adding original plain-English explanations, topic tags,
  positional-choice metadata, 35 multi-card group briefings, and dark-mode
  vector SVG renderings (`scripts/figures_svg.py`) for Figures T-1, T-2,
  and T-3.

